      "writtenOn": "2023-08-24T17:51:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "but it is used for strings:\n```\nname \u003d \u0027Tushar\u0027\nage \u003d 23\nprint(f\"Hello, My name is {name} and I\u0027m {age} years old.\")\n```\n\nwas wondering if `[\"ssh\", f\"-p{port}\", host, \"--\"]` can be simplified as `f\"ssh -p{port} host --\"`\n\nIs there a Google readability doc about fstrings. I am curious to read more",
      "parentUuid": "ff432f79_6f7f00c7",
